                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Really fun game overall, but the later levels get progressively worse and honestly pretty annoying. A lot of the rooms are just obnoxious, the shift blocking stuff just slows down the game and is not fun, some levels just feel like dumb luck on whether or not you win it, and the final boss honestly sucks. Early on it's some of the most fun I've had, the movement is really satisfying and it's fun shifting around and beating people up, and the mechanics are pretty cool; but goddamn does it suffer later on. If it was just the first half-ish it'd be a 10/10 game.",
